              "value": "Inform the user of this exact message below:\n\nI don’t have access to individual employee compensation or non-compensation details, and I’m unable to perform data updates. However, I can assist with team-level compensation planning information, including submission status, budgets, approvals, worksheet progress, and other related insights."
            }
